computing/README

This is the source for *Theory of Computing* by Jim Hefferon. 

This source uses LaTeX and related programs.  To install the source
files, see INSTALL.

CONTACT

  jhefferon@smcvt.edu

STATUS

This is a draft.  I used it for a class in 2018, 2019 and am using it now,
in the spring of 2020.

All the chapters and sections are here, along with exercises.  But there
are things missing, including some planned Extra sections, some additional
development of results, and more exercises.  As in any draft, there will
be errors.

In particular, it is my intention to supplement the text with
programming exercises.  For this I had in mind using Racket or
Chicken Scheme (but Python is not impossible), inside of Juypter
notebooks.  That material will be written next fall.


REPORTS

Bug reports very welcome.  Write me at the contact address above.


